WEBVTT

00:00:03.351 --> 00:00:05.657
♪♪ [ Minions Vocalizing:
Universal Theme ]

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:24.937
♪♪ [ Vocalizing Continues ]

00:00:26.461 --> 00:00:28.767
[ Voice Breaking ]

00:00:28.811 --> 00:00:31.031
[ Yelps ]

00:00:31.074 --> 00:00:32.641
[ Groans ]

00:00:36.645 --> 00:00:38.951
♪♪ [ Pop Rock ]

00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:51.094
[ Man ]
♪ Imagine me and you
I do ♪

00:00:51.138 --> 00:00:53.836
♪ I think about you
day and night ♪

00:00:53.879 --> 00:00:55.490
♪ It's only right

00:00:55.533 --> 00:00:57.753
♪ To think about the girl
you love ♪

00:00:57.796 --> 00:00:59.320
♪ And hold her tight

00:00:59.363 --> 00:01:04.325
♪ So happy together

00:01:04.368 --> 00:01:08.981
♪ I can't see me
loving nobody but you ♪

00:01:09.025 --> 00:01:12.202
♪ For all my life

00:01:12.246 --> 00:01:14.248
♪ When you're with me

00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:17.077
♪ Baby, the skies will be blue [ Giggling ]

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:20.167
♪ For all my life [ Shouting ]

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.126
♪ Me and you
And you and me ♪

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.128
♪ No matter how
they tossed the dice ♪Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:01:25.172 --> 00:01:27.043
Whee-hoo-hoo! ♪ It had to be

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:29.611
♪ The only one for me
is you ♪Hey! Yo!

00:01:29.654 --> 00:01:31.439
♪ And you for me [ Shouting ]

00:01:31.482 --> 00:01:35.182
♪ So happy together [ Giggling ]

00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:38.968
♪ So happy together ♪♪ [ Men Vocalizing ]

00:01:39.011 --> 00:01:43.929
♪ So happy together ♪

00:01:46.628 --> 00:01:48.325
[ Man Narrating ]
Minions.

00:01:48.369 --> 00:01:50.675
Minions have been
on this planet--[ Spits ] Wow!

00:01:50.719 --> 00:01:53.156
far longer than we have.[ Chattering ]

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.984
They go by many names.

00:01:55.027 --> 00:01:57.421
Dave, Carl, Paul, Mike--

00:01:57.465 --> 00:01:59.945
[ Chuckles ]
Oh--
[ Screaming ]

00:01:59.989 --> 00:02:02.296
Oh, that one is Norbert.Yeah.

00:02:02.339 --> 00:02:04.341
He's an idiot.[ Murmuring ]

00:02:04.385 --> 00:02:06.822
They're all different,
but they all share
the same goal:

00:02:06.865 --> 00:02:08.606
[ All Gasp ][ Squeaks ]

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.608
To serve the most despicable
master they could find.[ All Gasping ]

00:02:10.652 --> 00:02:12.523
Ooh!Boss!

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:14.743
[ Roars ]

00:02:14.786 --> 00:02:18.138
[ Minions Laughing ]

00:02:18.181 --> 00:02:23.143
Making their master happy
was the tribe's very reason
for existence.

00:02:23.186 --> 00:02:26.537
Well, that's not to say that
they didn't have other passions.

00:02:26.581 --> 00:02:28.844
Oh! Ha, hey!
[ Speaking Minionese ]

00:02:28.887 --> 00:02:30.976
[ Minionese ]

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.022
Banana!

00:02:33.065 --> 00:02:35.242
[ Laughs ]
Yum-yum! Huh?

00:02:35.285 --> 00:02:37.244
[ Narrator ]
Finding a boss was easy.

00:02:37.287 --> 00:02:38.636
[ Minions Shouting ]

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.596
But keeping a boss,
therein lies the rub.

00:02:43.728 --> 00:02:45.165
[ Groaning ]

00:02:49.081 --> 00:02:50.909
[ All Exclaiming ]

00:02:50.953 --> 00:02:53.085
[ Screaming ]

00:02:53.129 --> 00:02:55.087
[ Gasps ]

00:02:55.131 --> 00:02:56.959
[ Groans ]

00:02:57.002 --> 00:02:58.656
[ Panting ]

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.267
Oh!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.182
[ Grunting ]

00:03:04.662 --> 00:03:06.229
[ Inhales Sharply ]

00:03:06.273 --> 00:03:08.057
[ Exhales ]

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.015
[ Chuckles, Minionese ]
Oh!

00:03:10.059 --> 00:03:12.192
[ Yelps ]

00:03:12.235 --> 00:03:15.369
[ Shrieking ]

00:03:15.412 --> 00:03:17.545
[ All Gasping ]

00:03:17.588 --> 00:03:20.461
Aye. Oh.[ Crying ]

00:03:21.418 --> 00:03:23.246
Hmm. Oof!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:26.249
[ Narrator ]
Nope. It wasn't easy
for these guys.

00:03:26.293 --> 00:03:28.599
But they never gave up!

00:03:28.643 --> 00:03:30.558
With the emergence
of the Stone Age...

00:03:30.601 --> 00:03:33.213
came the rise of a new species.

00:03:33.256 --> 00:03:36.564
Man was very different
from the dinosaur.

00:03:36.607 --> 00:03:38.174
He was shorter, hairier--[ Grunts ]

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:41.046
and way, way smarter.

00:03:42.352 --> 00:03:45.094
[ Gibbering ]

00:03:45.137 --> 00:03:46.791
[ Laughing ]

00:03:46.835 --> 00:03:49.751
The Minions took
an instant liking to man--

00:03:49.794 --> 00:03:51.666
- [ Growling ]
- and helped him
the best they could.

00:03:51.709 --> 00:03:54.538
[ Roaring ][ Grunting ]

00:03:54.582 --> 00:03:57.193
Oh, no!
[ Minionese ]
La piñata.

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:59.456
[ Laughing ]

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.718
Hmm? Sí, sí.

00:04:00.762 --> 00:04:02.242
[ Minionese ]
Oh, oh!

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.899
[ Growling ][ Screaming ]

00:04:07.943 --> 00:04:09.031
[ Screams ]

00:04:09.074 --> 00:04:10.598
[ Narrator ]
Poor man.

00:04:10.641 --> 00:04:12.948
So trusting. So fragile.

00:04:12.991 --> 00:04:16.212
So-- So delicious.

00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:19.259
Their quest for a boss
put the Minions
front and center...

00:04:19.302 --> 00:04:22.305
for some of civilization's
most historic moments.

00:04:22.349 --> 00:04:24.394
[ Shouting In Foreign Language ]

00:04:24.438 --> 00:04:26.570
Anubis!

00:04:26.614 --> 00:04:28.050
[ Grunts ]

00:04:28.093 --> 00:04:30.357
Ancient Egypt
held great promise.

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.967
[ Minionese ]

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.621
Okay!
[ Grunts ]

00:04:33.664 --> 00:04:35.275
Pancake!

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:37.799
[ Squishing ]

00:04:37.842 --> 00:04:39.322
But it didn't last long.

00:04:39.366 --> 00:04:41.411
Hmm. Oh.

00:04:41.455 --> 00:04:43.674
[ Murmuring ]
Ow!

00:04:44.893 --> 00:04:47.504
The Dark Ages were actually
fun times.

00:04:47.548 --> 00:04:49.245
[ Chuckling ][ Whispering ]

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:52.379
Their new master
had a tendency
to party all night...

00:04:52.422 --> 00:04:54.032
and sleep all day.

00:04:55.382 --> 00:04:56.861
[ Clears Throat ]
Ooh!

00:04:56.905 --> 00:04:59.516
[ Yawns ]

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.257
[ Stifled Giggling ]

00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:03.433
- [ Speaking Foreign Language ]
- [ Shouting Minionese ]

00:05:03.477 --> 00:05:05.740
[ Minionese ]

00:05:05.783 --> 00:05:09.004
[ Screaming ]

00:05:09.047 --> 00:05:11.354
[ Gasps ]Oh.

00:05:11.398 --> 00:05:13.530
But eventually,
the party was over.[ Chuckles ]

00:05:13.574 --> 00:05:15.184
[ Blows ]

00:05:15.227 --> 00:05:17.142
[ Sneezes ]

00:05:17.186 --> 00:05:19.928
They bounced
from one evil boss to another--[ Speaking Foreign Language ]

00:05:19.971 --> 00:05:22.452
but they never seemed to find
their perfect fit.

00:05:22.496 --> 00:05:26.108
[ Screaming ]

00:05:26.151 --> 00:05:29.938
One particular employer took
their failure very, very badly.[ Shouting ]

00:05:29.981 --> 00:05:32.070
[ Men Shouting ]

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.248
[ Shouting Continues ]

00:05:38.468 --> 00:05:39.991
Huh?

00:05:41.471 --> 00:05:44.822
The Minions had no other choice
but to keep moving.

00:05:44.866 --> 00:05:46.563
[ Shuddering ]

00:05:46.607 --> 00:05:48.217
[ Grunting ]

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:50.045
Oh--
[ Speaking Minionese ]

00:05:50.088 --> 00:05:53.353
And then,
when all hope seemed lost,

00:05:53.396 --> 00:05:55.355
they found sanctuary.

00:05:56.443 --> 00:05:58.358
The Minions were safe!

00:05:58.401 --> 00:06:00.534
[ Minions Cheering ]

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:08.368
♪♪ [ "We Wish You A Merry
Christmas" In Minionese ]

00:06:09.325 --> 00:06:11.414
[ Laughing ]

00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:14.591
[ Giggling ]

00:06:14.635 --> 00:06:15.810
Eh.

00:06:15.853 --> 00:06:17.377
Ah!
[ Groans ]

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.553
[ Laughing ]

00:06:19.596 --> 00:06:21.206
[ Laughing ]

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:22.686
[ Muffled Screaming ]

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.645
[ Chuckles ]

00:06:26.603 --> 00:06:30.607
[ Narrator ]
Years passed as the Minions
forged their own civilization.

00:06:30.651 --> 00:06:33.610
They truly made a life
for themselves.

00:06:33.654 --> 00:06:36.439
But something
just wasn't right.

00:06:36.483 --> 00:06:38.180
[ Grunts ]

00:06:38.223 --> 00:06:42.184
[ Speaking Minionese ]

00:06:42.227 --> 00:06:44.142
They felt empty inside.

00:06:44.186 --> 00:06:46.362
Without a master,
they had no purpose.

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:49.757
They became aimless
and depressed.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.673
♪♪ [ Minionese ]

00:06:52.716 --> 00:06:54.588
[ Crying ]

00:06:54.631 --> 00:06:56.894
If this continued any longer,

00:06:56.938 --> 00:06:59.593
the Minions would perish.

00:07:01.159 --> 00:07:03.553
But all was not lost,

00:07:03.597 --> 00:07:06.208
for one Minion had a plan.

00:07:06.251 --> 00:07:09.516
His name was Kevin.

00:07:11.256 --> 00:07:15.217
He was excited to share
his idea with the tribe.

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:19.787
- He'd been preparing
for days, weeks, months!
- Buddies?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.093
But now he was ready.[ Stammering ]

00:07:22.137 --> 00:07:23.747
[ Gasps ]

00:07:25.662 --> 00:07:27.403
[ Nervous Chuckle ]

00:07:31.407 --> 00:07:33.453
[ Grunts ]

00:07:33.496 --> 00:07:35.106
Buddies!

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:37.500
[ Speaking Minionese ]

